To Add Variable Groups 
In Azure DevOps → Pipelines → Library, create 3 variable groups:

ADF_DW_Dev_VG, ADF_DW_Uat_VG, ADF_DW_Prod_VG

Name: ADF_DW_Dev_VG
Variables:
  dataFactoryName = Cyg-DataFactory
  subscriptionId = <replace with actual dev subscription ID>
  resourceGroupName = ADF-Dev-RG
  linkedServiceSnowflake = SnowflakeReportingDev
  linkedServiceSQL = LinkedService_SQL_Server
  linkedServiceBlob = Clinical2
  
